Package: totaljs-mozilla-source
Version: 1.0.0-1
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Total.js <repository@totaljs.com>
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Depends: ca-certificates
Homepage: https://support.mozilla.org/kb/install-firefox-linux
Description: The repository of Mozilla, for the Total.js Developer Distros
 The signing key and the source of apt of the repository of Mozilla (packages.mozilla.org),
 where Firefox comes from as a normal package (Ubuntu offers it only as a snap). The key is the
 official one of Mozilla (fingerprint 35BA A0B3 3E9E B396 F59C A838 C0BA 5CE6 DC63 15A3). The
 repository has priority over the one of Ubuntu for its own packages only.
